---
// Ill07ConduitToBusiness.astro
// Visual brief: The Spectrum — From Conduit to Operating Business
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 07</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Economic Substance Spectrum</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 rounded border border-amber-500/20 font-medium">Category Threshold</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <!-- Spectrum Bar -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <!-- Item 1 -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono">1</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Passive Capital Allocation</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Angel funds, infrastructure, social ventures (Cat I)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded font-semibold">Pure Conduit</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 2 -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono">2</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Private Equity / Private Debt</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Unlisted buyout, 5–7 year horizon, no leverage (Cat II)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 rounded font-semibold">Statutory Look-Through</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 3 -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/40 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono">3</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Active Long/Short Equity</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Frequent portfolio rebalancing, listed cash market (Cat III)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/50 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 rounded font-semibold">Hybrid Boundary</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 4 -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-amber-50/60 dark:bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-800 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono">4</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Hedge & Leveraged Arbitrage</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Complex derivatives, options, intraday spreads, leverage (Cat III)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-800 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 rounded font-semibold">Operating Business</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Directional Axis -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 px-1">
      <span>← LESS ECONOMIC SUBSTANCE (CONDUIT)</span>
      <span>MORE ECONOMIC SUBSTANCE (BUSINESS) →</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">The Category III distinction can be understood as a boundary between the fund that looks like a conduit and the fund that increasingly looks like an operating business.</p>
  </div>
</div>
